        {
            "id": "page3",
            "speaker": "wulfricunknown",
            "lines": [
                "Welcome to the Pokémon Village. This place is a secret, y'know?"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page4');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        
        {
            "id": "page4",
            "speaker": "wulfricunknown",
            "lines": [
                "Most of the Pokémon here are runaways--escaped from bad people who did awful things to them."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page5');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        
        {
            "id": "page5",
            "speaker": "wulfricunknown",
            "lines": [
                "It's a shame how many heartless Trainers who can't bother to care for their Pokémon are out there."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page6');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        
        {
            "id": "page6",
            "speaker": "wulfricunknown",
            "lines": [
                "Some of these Pokémon, though..."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page7');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        
        {
            "id": "page7",
            "speaker": "wulfricunknown",
            "lines": [
                "Some of 'em are just too strong and found they didn't really have a place in the outside world, so they came here."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page8');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        
        {
            "id": "page8",
            "speaker": "wulfricunknown",
            "lines": [
                "Hmm... I see. Your Pokémon sure seem to think highly of you. You've had some good times together, haven't you?"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page9');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        
        {
            "id": "page9",
            "speaker": "wulfricunknown",
            "lines": [
                "Sometimes I get worried and come here to check on everyone."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page10');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        
        {
            "id": "page10",
            "speaker": "wulfricunknown",
            "lines": [
                "Oh--excuse my manners. We haven't even had a proper introduction yet."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page11');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        
        {
            "id": "page11",
            "speaker": "wulfric",
            "lines": [
                "The name's Wulfric. I'm usually over at the Gym in Snowbelle City, since I'm the Gym Leader and all."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page12');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        
        {
            "id": "page12",
            "speaker": "wulfric",
            "lines": [
                "Let me guess--you want to challenge me?"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page13');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        
        {
            "id": "page13",
            "speaker": "wulfric",
            "lines": [
                "I thought so. Sorry to inconvenience you like this."
